				<wikidot:authorName>Dewman</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>628488</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Pandora's Box is coming back?<br /> On the one hand, that seems pretty far-fetched and like it's not gonna work out.<br /> On the other hand, this whole &quot;resurrection&quot; thing has so far been contributed to by <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">three</span> four of the site's most renowned writers, five if Zyn is getting involved too.</p> <p>So I am not apprehensive, so much as I am excited.<br /> I especially like all the little references (166, Flytrap, Game Day,) and the not so little ones (Termination Order) and the fact that Doctor Clef's Bisexual Assassination Squad is now a real thing (at least in this series). I thought Clef's crotch having a hand that holds a gun would be the most ridiculous thing that ever made it into a <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/upswing-of-disorder">story</a>.<br /> dis looks liek it gon' be gud.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
